                                "example_id": "40a0ffa9-aec6-4fe9-a93c-3bd6fb8a43b1",
                                "sense_id": "231eb2f8-438d-3725-9558-c092d5cd8587",
                                "text": "The third method of forming the mixed material comprises the steps of: adding a benzoguanamine resin to formaldehyde to form an intermediate; adding the intermediate to a solution consisting of polyethylene to form a galactoid solution; adding a hardening catalyst and mixing the galactoid solution with the protrusion material; and performing sequentially the steps of heating, disengaging, cleaning and drying to form a hardened resin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "464e3d7b-df1c-417a-ae8d-25c69f1b0b0d",
                                "sense_id": "231eb2f8-438d-3725-9558-c092d5cd8587",
                                "text": "After agitation for 30 sec, white galactoid microbubble suspension was prepared."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "841b4a63-80bb-40f9-a169-fc9e4bfa1eba",
                                "sense_id": "231eb2f8-438d-3725-9558-c092d5cd8587",
                                "text": "Furthermore, petroleum sulfonate was not readily dissolved and its aqueous solution was susceptible to stratification when the reaction time was 0 min because of its high free oil content, while at an extended reaction condition, the sulfonate solution was aqueous with a tea-like color but not galactoid."
